Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.14,0:00:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Proceed to Pompeii.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.90,0:00:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I have hidden a key somewhere\Nnear the Cave Cana mosaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.14,0:00:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This hidden key will operate\Nthe vehicle that'll allow
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.76,0:00:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,your team safe passage as you deliver\Nmy daughter. Fugo! Abbacchio! Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.34,0:00:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You three will travel to\NPompeii to secure that key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.58,0:01:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,In my life, I won't be able to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.10,0:01:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll continue to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I will be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.96,0:01:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,able to fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting God?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Pompeii, ancient Roman resort\Nand city of culture and vitality.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,When Mount Vesuvius erupted back in AD 79,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.14,0:02:03.52,Default,,0,0,0,,the city was ravaged by\Nfire and buried by ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.96,0:02:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a catastrophe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Later, archaeologists discovered\Na metropolis frozen in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.38,0:02:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything there was preserved.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.92,0:02:16.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Entire villas, wine bottles,\Nroads, even carriage tracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.02,0:02:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're aware,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.46,0:02:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,the Cave Canem is a mosaic\Nof a dog located in the
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.50,0:02:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,vestibule of the so-called\NHouse of the Tragic Poet.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.32,0:02:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.56,0:02:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems we needed to turn\Nright back there, not left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.42,0:02:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't it a little bit late\Nto be telling me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.14,0:02:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me, what good does it do to\Ninform me of a turn after the fact?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.88,0:02:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely right. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.32,0:02:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Next time, I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.58,0:02:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I say anything about\Nnext time, new kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking about now!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Check your emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in a hurry, so calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't think I know that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.40,0:03:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's annoying as shit,\Nbut this is typical Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.86,0:03:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,What's really bugging me is this\Nnew recruit, Giorno Giovanna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.92,0:03:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Uttarati wants us to treat him as one\Nof our own, so I'll do what I must.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.64,0:03:21.46,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's something about this\Nguy, something I can't get past.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.08,0:03:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Eventually, he's going to screw up big\Ntime, and his blunder could get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.78,0:03:34.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Good old Pompei.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.32,0:03:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't set foot\Nthere since I was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.98,0:03:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Abacchio, Giorno, let's hustle.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our destination is about\Na hundred meters ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.76,0:03:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It should take thirty minutes or so to get
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.84,0:03:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,what we need and hightail it back to camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.86,0:04:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Abbacchio, Giorno, eyes up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.64,0:04:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that didn't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.72,0:04:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How many?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.20,0:04:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.16,0:04:15.57,Default,,0,0,0,,At least for the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.70,0:04:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He's watching us from behind that pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.14,0:04:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And by that pillar, which\None do you mean exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.70,0:04:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Open your damn eyes, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.54,0:04:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There's only one pillar here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't see it from there?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.92,0:04:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo, you're definitely\Nright about the pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But there's no one watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what I'm looking at, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's closing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.58,0:04:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo! Right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.14,0:04:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's sauntering this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I saw him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.82,0:04:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy just came out\Nfrom behind that pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw his every move with this mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.02,0:04:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,There he is! Look there! He came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.24,0:05:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is he skulking in the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.18,0:05:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He showed his stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.68,0:05:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,One of you attacked!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.59,0:05:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a beat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.54,0:05:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing you've said in the last\Nfew minutes has made any sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is something the\Nmatter with the mirror?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.58,0:05:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.49,0:05:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,He's coming in for the kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.76,0:05:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to get away from the mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.86,0:05:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Giorno! Abokyo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.34,0:05:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.20,0:05:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.28,0:05:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That mirror freak vanished, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.94,0:05:38.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.32,0:05:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course the creepy hanging\Nmirror was a red flag.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.70,0:05:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell did I fall for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.46,0:05:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this guy's stand?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.32,0:05:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I don't know what it is, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.52,0:05:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about this place\Njust doesn't look right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.94,0:05:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiao!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.76,0:06:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Panna Code Fugo M.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.86,0:06:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Your IQ is 152, and you entered\Nuniversity at the age of 13.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.76,0:06:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But a certain professor\Nrubbed you the wrong way,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,so you decided to beat him to a\Nbloody pulp with an encyclopedia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.94,0:06:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, the rest is a\Ndepressing biography.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.94,0:06:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You're currently traveling with\Nthe failed cop, Leone Abbacchio,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.06,0:06:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,as well as the lack of\Ndata must mean he's new.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I believe you called him Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.64,0:06:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.80,0:06:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Out with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you put them?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.50,0:06:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.92,0:06:47.24,Default,,0,0,0,,My watch is backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.72,0:06:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,And now it's on my right wrist,\Nwhich doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.54,0:06:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I get it. Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.92,0:06:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what your stand does.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.88,0:06:59.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you were quick,\Nbut that was impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.06,0:07:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I like your eagerness, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.36,0:07:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit that I wasn't aiming for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.66,0:07:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,but since you noticed the\Nmirror before the others,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.36,0:07:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,you get to go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.38,0:07:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Abbacchio and Giorno didn't disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some kind of mirror world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.12,0:07:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the victim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He dragged me into his\Nown little playground.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.50,0:07:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.84,0:07:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Come out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, didn't you see\Nanything suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.48,0:07:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,One second I'm looking at\Nhim, the next he's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.44,0:07:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Right before he vanished, he warned\Nus to get away from the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.32,0:07:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He asked if we could see the man\Nwalking from behind the pillar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.18,0:07:44.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.84,0:07:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Strano.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's off about this mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.82,0:07:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for the question at hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.16,0:07:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you and your comrades\Nhide the boss's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.50,0:07:58.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I should say that's\Nthe more important question.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.08,0:08:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,My other question concerns why you goons\Nare snooping around the city of death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.78,0:08:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the piece of this puzzle\NI just can't seem to ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.82,0:08:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't take a genius to figure out\Nyou came here searching for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:12.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,it would have to be vital to protecting\Nthe girl to justify coming all this way,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.20,0:08:18.03,Default,,0,0,0,,right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.11,0:08:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just around that corner, you'll\Nfind the famous Cave Cana mosaic.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.62,0:08:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that where your prize lies?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.30,0:08:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever it is, I'm taking it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.76,0:08:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do yourself a favor and tell\Nme what this thing is, Fugo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So you choose death, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.38,0:08:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong, Stranzo!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.82,0:08:40.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That honor will go to you once\NI unleash my stand's power!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:41.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Purple smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.06,0:08:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't manifest. Why? I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.52,0:08:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Purple smoke, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.04,0:08:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an interesting name\Nfor your no-show ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.94,0:08:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm absolutely sure I\Nbrought out my stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I can even feel its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.66,0:09:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,So where the hell is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.38,0:09:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Giorno, I need you\Nto walk toward me slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.30,0:09:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You need me to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.14,0:09:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your newbie ass over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.30,0:09:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We're running out of time!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.56,0:09:14.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Move it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.87,0:09:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we being attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,No, kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.70,0:09:20.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand down now!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.92,0:09:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fugo's stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.06,0:09:27.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless you want to die, quick\Ndigging around and get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.76,0:09:30.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugos, move away from purple smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.56,0:09:31.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.30,0:09:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose I should tell\Nyou you're inside a mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.70,0:09:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know why I pulled you\Nin here all by your lonesome?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.08,0:09:47.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hint, it's not for the peace and quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.46,0:09:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's cause bringing\Nalong any of your fellow
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.52,0:09:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,combatants could put my\Nown safety in jeopardy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.14,0:09:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and I just can't have that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.48,0:09:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I control everything here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.90,0:09:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That is my unique talent.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.80,0:10:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,All you see before you is\Ndevoid of life, fully inanimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.54,0:10:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the only living\Nthings in this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.12,0:10:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I made it a point to\Nkeep everything else out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.00,0:10:11.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I permitted your entry\Nbecause my plan needed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.52,0:10:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You catching on?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.68,0:10:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your stand manifested on the\Nother side of the mirror!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.06,0:10:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Now feast your eyes upon my mirror man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.42,0:10:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Purple smoke materialized on the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare, but there's\Ngot to be a way I can fight back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.26,0:10:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Panacota Fugo was born\Ninto tremendous wealth
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.92,0:10:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and lived on a vast estate outside Napoli.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.36,0:10:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He was blessed, not only with\Na life of luxury and privilege,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.14,0:10:54.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but with a great intellect as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.24,0:10:58.40,Default,,0,0,0,,To many, he lived the perfect\Nlife, devoid of any hardship.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,But what the public didn't see were the
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.28,0:11:03.96,Default,,0,0,0,,many expectations placed\Non Fugo's shoulders.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The pressure from them was\Ncrushing his spirit day by day.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.26,0:11:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,At times, Fugo suffered bouts of inexplicable\Nrage, which caused him to act out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a deep anger that took\Nall his might to contain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.46,0:11:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,At the age of just 13,\Nhe began university.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.56,0:11:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It was there that his near-uncontrollable\Nfuror erupted into tragedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.52,0:11:34.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Professor.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.36,0:11:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now what could you be up\Nto at this ungodly hour?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.94,0:11:41.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for our assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.46,0:11:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't find the judicial precedent.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.96,0:11:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't be silly. You\Nknow that. You can always.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.42,0:11:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,come to me with anything hard that arises.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.40,0:11:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,No I wouldn't want to\Ntrouble you if I don't
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.00,0:11:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,have to guiding gifted\Nyoung men like you is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:12:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No trouble at all it's\Nmy scholarly duty how
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.60,0:12:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,about it have dinner at\Nmy place and I'll teach.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You a few things I have\Nto go now wait just a
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.22,0:12:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,moment I'd be more than\Nhappy to loose my lips.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.30,0:12:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,regarding the questions\Non the next big test.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's going to be just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.44,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.35,0:12:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Relax, you're in good hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.78,0:12:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your hands off me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked up to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to be like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.10,0:12:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You disgusting piece of shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.20,0:12:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Profissori's\Ngetting real cozy with Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.92,0:12:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure Fugo didn't bait the hook?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.52,0:12:42.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That would explain how he\Ngot into a school like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.70,0:12:48.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo's parents leveraged their wealth\Nto ensure all charges were dropped.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:54.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But they no longer treated him like a son,\Nand he was no longer part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.00,0:12:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Without support, Fugo turned to\Nshoplifting and pickpocketing for survival.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In an ironic twist of fate,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,it was his new way of life that\Nwould make full use of his intellect.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.98,0:13:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think you could just\Nrun away without paying?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you rot in jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.32,0:13:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you will never be\Nable to put me behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.90,0:13:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it you're not\Nfamiliar with De Seiko vs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.60,0:13:18.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Argento, 1982?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.66,0:13:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Based on the results of that case,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.70,0:13:26.47,Default,,0,0,0,,it is highly likely that the court will\Ndetermine I acted out of basic necessity.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.34,0:13:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Bucciarati, please, you have to\Ndo something about this child!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.90,0:13:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:34.76,Default,,0,0,0,,How interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.40,0:13:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo's visit happened to\Noccur right as Bucciarati
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.06,0:13:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,was pondering the\Nformation of his own team.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.00,0:13:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,There.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.96,0:13:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you basically know\Neverything about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.62,0:13:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You can stop feeling sorry for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.04,0:13:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not unhappy if that helps.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.74,0:13:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I see. Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.08,0:13:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think you're here today by chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.14,0:14:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you join my team, Panakata Fugo?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your intellect is one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.92,0:14:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.96,0:14:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got nothing against becoming a\Nmafioso, but I've made up my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.98,0:14:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for the best if I go it\Nalone in life. Oh? Why's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.04,0:14:16.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.95,0:14:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,When I lose my temper, my\Ndarkest thoughts take over.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.86,0:14:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,If I acquiesced and\Njoined up with your team,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't guarantee I wouldn't kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.62,0:14:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, lucky for you, I'm\Nwilling to bet on those odds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.50,0:14:31.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave your past and come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.26,0:14:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear you and your\Ntalents will be respected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.90,0:14:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you here, demons and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.26,0:14:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,His words stirred Fugo's soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.72,0:14:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon after, Fugo would undergo Pulpo's\Ntest and would acquire Purple Smoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,So this is Fugo's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.28,0:14:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo's nowhere to be seen,\Nbut somehow his stand is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.94,0:14:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He materialized his stand,\Nwhich means he's alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.32,0:15:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,At least for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.00,0:15:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, where the hell did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he going to protect himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.02,0:15:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back, Giorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo almost never manifests his stand,\Nunless he's totally out of options.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.40,0:15:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's more than likely fighting\Nfor his life right this second.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.86,0:15:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.56,0:15:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He seems more concerned about that stand\Nthan finding out where Fugo's been taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.46,0:15:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he feels threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.98,0:15:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would it be lashing\Nout all of a sudden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.26,0:15:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.50,0:15:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.88,0:15:39.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.78,0:15:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.68,0:15:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's in that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.98,0:15:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.66,0:15:47.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Until we know exactly where\Nhe is, nothing else matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.24,0:15:50.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really getting tired of\Nthat mouth of yours, pissant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.20,0:15:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're an annoying brown noser,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but I thought I'd be nice and\Ngive the poor newbie a heads up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.94,0:15:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It's attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:16:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Giorno, get moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.24,0:16:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So you activated your\Nstand outside the mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.46,0:16:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, that doesn't change a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It really doesn't matter what\Nkind of tricks your stand can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.96,0:16:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing it does will\Nhave any effect on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I, on the other hand, will make you my\Npunching bag and finish you at my leisure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.60,0:16:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? A crow?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But why'd it fall out of the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.46,0:16:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It died.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.68,0:16:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But how come? Stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.74,0:16:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,When purple smoke starts\Nswinging its fists,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.36,0:16:42.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you better hope you're\Nas far away as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.18,0:16:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is up with all these dead animals?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a lethal virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.90,0:16:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of Fugo's stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.94,0:16:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a ghastly ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.66,0:17:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How is that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.16,0:17:03.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Take a look at its hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.94,0:17:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When its fists strike\Nsomething, the capsules shatter,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.40,0:17:10.11,Default,,0,0,0,,spewing the infectious\Nagent contained inside?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,into the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.27,0:17:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once airborne,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.22,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,the virus infiltrates the body through\Nrespiration or contact with the skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.10,0:17:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It then multiplies violently.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.88,0:17:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Viral pathogenesis sets\Nin, and then, death.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.64,0:17:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Once the virus begins to spread,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,any living organism is\Nsubject to its devastating
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.82,0:17:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,effects like those crows\Nyour body's metabolic
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.94,0:17:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,functions will fail as you\Ndecompose from the inside
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.98,0:17:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,out along with your stand\Nand would you happen to
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,know its range five meters\Nsince he can still control
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.58,0:17:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,his stand he's no farther\Nthan five meters away
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.36,0:17:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,that's a good start but\Nhow far does the virus
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.56,0:17:52.08,Default,,0,0,0,,reach i guess i'm asking\Nwhat's the infection radius?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.76,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We're safe at this distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.38,0:17:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,When the virus is exposed to the elements,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.14,0:18:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,even indoor light can exterminate\Nit after prolonged exposure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:05.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The sunlight should have those\Ncrows disinfected before too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.80,0:18:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.38,0:18:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That beast blasts its victims\Nwith a viral cloud of death,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.98,0:18:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,then melts them into nothingness.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.12,0:18:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're looking at is the\Nembodiment of Fugo's ferocity.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.74,0:18:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh, what's it doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.48,0:18:27.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to wipe the drool\Noff his leg, I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That angry grimace is his signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.06,0:18:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He's extremely neurotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The slightest bit of grime annoys him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.08,0:18:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Every stan's got its\Nown quirks, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to be rude, but it doesn't\Nseem to be very bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.46,0:18:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're only seeing the manifestation\Nof his most savage side.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.08,0:19:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Since that's the case, it stands to\Nreason Fugo can't see purple smoke at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.10,0:19:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That means he's having\Ntrouble controlling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.68,0:19:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,He would never let it\Nact like that otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.00,0:19:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Its body.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.64,0:19:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.40,0:19:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The crow looks like it's\Ndiseased or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,But is it bacterial or viral?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.92,0:19:29.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.24,0:19:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo's lost his grip on his stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.46,0:19:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,He's randomly attacking\Nthings in a fit of rage.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.50,0:19:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,No, there's nothing random about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.36,0:19:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be something\Nhidden in that mirror.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:44.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He targeted the mirror from the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.12,0:19:46.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time, Fugo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.38,0:19:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing special\Nabout the mirror you destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.88,0:19:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what your stand tries to do, no\Nmatter what tricks it has up its sleeve...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Mirror Man's World is impenetrable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.40,0:19:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even viruses can find their way in!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.72,0:20:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Abacchio, Giorno, you have to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.12,0:20:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't let him drag you\Ninto this Mirror World.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.58,0:20:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to get out of here. Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.32,0:20:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Giorno!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.56,0:20:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to go! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.60,0:20:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.94,0:20:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Move to where?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.22,0:20:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you don't mean to find the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you really ditch\NFugo here and let him die?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.42,0:20:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I strongly suggest watching\Nyour mouth, kid. Listen well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.42,0:20:38.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The mission is to get the key and\Nsafely deliver the girl to the boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our first priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to save Fugo as much as you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hell, even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.24,0:20:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But getting that damn key is more\Nimportant than our personal feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.62,0:20:50.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were me confined inside that\Nmirror right now instead of Fugo,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.92,0:20:53.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd want you to make the very same call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.38,0:20:55.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but with all due respect...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.02,0:20:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.88,0:21:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Fugo is in serious danger, but\Nthat doesn't mean it's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.12,0:21:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's our duty to bring him\Nback safely. But first,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.68,0:21:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,we have to find out how this guy's attacking\Nus, or we might as well pack it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think this is bad, wait\Ntill all three of us are taken out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.80,0:21:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Again!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.71,0:21:16.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We are leaving! Now! I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.24,0:21:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Finding Fugo, and taking\Nthis guy down's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.52,0:21:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me, none of us\Nwill be safe otherwise.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.30,0:21:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I outrank your stupid ass, you\Nparvenu prick, so what I say goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.60,0:21:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You still refusing my order?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.80,0:21:35.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's your funeral!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You had better be prepared\Nto not survive this fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll ask you once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.12,0:21:49.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What was your team hoping\Nto find here in Pompeii?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.96,0:21:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never tell a scum like you. That so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.54,0:21:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.88,0:21:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,But they're still your two friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:22:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure one of them could be\Npersuaded into spilling their guts.
